        "In two years, I will have saved",
        "enough money for a new laptop."
      ],
      "audioText": "In two years, I will have saved enough money for a new laptop.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n4-digital-future-2"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n4.class-67.t02",
      "en": "By 2030, most cars in our city will have become electric.",
      "es": "Para 2030, la mayoría de los coches de nuestra ciudad se habrán vuelto eléctricos.",
